        "status": "complete",
        "judged": true,
        "correct": true,
        "evidenceCount": 32,
        "dateHint": false,
        "dateHit": null,
        "answer": "《百年孤独》吧\n那会儿你说在图书馆学习，结果被这本勾走了"
