        "status": "complete",
        "judged": true,
        "correct": true,
        "evidenceCount": 87,
        "dateHint": false,
        "dateHit": null,
        "answer": "《流浪地球》啊 你说画面特别震撼的那个"
      },
      {
        "caseId": "membank-cn-p07-q03",
        "persona": "张曼婷",
        "status": "complete",
        "judged": true,
        "correct": true,
        "evidenceCount": 103,
        "dateHint": false,
        "dateHit": null,
        "answer": "翻到过一次，就那回\n\n你学画画那阵说想练形象和自然，我给你提了达·芬奇、米开朗基罗、拉斐尔，文艺复兴那批人\n别的画家我没推过，就这三位"
      },
      {
        "caseId": "membank-cn-p07-q04",
        "persona": "张曼婷",
        "status": "complete",
        "judged": true,
        "correct": true,
        "evidenceCount": 76,
        "dateHint": false,
        "dateHit": null,
        "answer": "记得啊，你说看到一朵开得特别美的樱花，还有一只超级可爱的松鼠"
      },
