        "status": "complete",
        "judged": true,
        "correct": true,
        "evidenceCount": 100,
        "dateHint": false,
        "dateHit": null,
        "answer": "文明 啊\n就是那次聊怎么学世界历史的时候，我顺嘴提的，说可以下载来边玩边记\n<"
      },
      {
